@rakutek/dsh-intelligent-ui README · 🛠️ How It Works (What the Model Writes)：The plugin injects concise instructions into the system prompt. The model writes standard Markdown enhanced with JSX-like component tags and reactive state declarations:

```md
{@body const [seats, setSeats] = useState(25)}
{@body const [price, setPrice] = useState(1200)}

<box border radius="xl" padding={3} gap={2}>

@rakutek/dsh-intelligent-ui README · 🛡️ Security & Privacy：- **Sandboxed Execution**: Expressions are evaluated via a safe AST interpreter. There is no `eval()`, `new Function()`, access to `window`/`document`, or network fetch access.
- **Local State Privacy**: Interactive input state is saved per message in your browser's local storage. Values are never sent to the model until you explicitly click an action button.
- **Safe Resources**: External links open via DeepSeek Harness's native safe URL handler. External images only load from model-specified HTTPS URLs.

@rakutek/dsh-intelligent-ui README · 📋 Compatibility：- **DeepSeek Harness**: `v0.2.0-rc.1` or later
- **Tested Models**: Claude 3.5 Sonnet / 3.7 Sonnet, GPT-4o / GPT-6.1, DeepSeek-V3 / R1

